---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import VideoBg from "../components/VideoBg.astro";
---

<Layout title="Scratch">
  <Nav />
  <section class="hero scratch">
    <div class="content__wrapper case"></div>
  </section>
  <section class="work white">
    <div class="work_wrapper">
      <div class="work-title">
        <h2 class="h2">SCRATCH</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="work_details">
        <ul role="list" class="list-2 work w-list-unstyled">
          <li class="list-title work">
            <div>SERVICES</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">BRANDING</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">VISUAL DESIGN</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">COPYWRITING</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">ILLUSTRATION</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">ICONOGRAPHY</div>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="work_intro">
          <p>There’s more to life than loans.<br><br>Scratch wants to majorly shake things up in the world of loan repayments. In a market that’s always been an area of outdated frustration for both lenders and borrowers, Scratch finally simplifies the process.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3646-73ce06da" class="w-layout-layout work_grid wf-layout-layout">
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3647-73ce06da" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/scratch-poster_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/scratch-poster_1scratch-poster.webp 500w, /images/scratch-poster_1scratch-poster.webp 800w, /images/scratch-poster_1scratch-poster.webp 1080w, /images/scratch-poster_1.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3653-73ce06da" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/scratch-float.mp4" img="/images/image-4.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/image-4-p-500.png 500w, /images/image-4-p-800.png 800w, /images/image-4-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/image-4.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd365f-73ce06da" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/scratch-billboard_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/scratch-billboard_1scratch-billboard.webp 500w, /images/scratch-billboard_1scratch-billboard.webp 800w, /images/scratch-billboard_1scratch-billboard.webp 1080w, /images/scratch-billboard_1scratch-billboard.webp 1600w, /images/scratch-billboard_1scratch-billboard.webp 2000w, /images/scratch-billboard_1scratch-billboard.webp 2600w, /images/scratch-billboard_1.webp 3000w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3669-73ce06da" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/scratch-ballon.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/scratch-ballon-p-500.png 500w, /images/scratch-ballon-p-800.png 800w, /images/scratch-ballon-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/scratch-ballon.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_4e46d753-55c9-db65-bd2c-6db41309ac57-73ce06da" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/scratch-loans_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/scratch-loans_1scratch-loans.webp 500w, /images/scratch-loans_1scratch-loans.webp 800w, /images/scratch-loans_1scratch-loans.webp 1080w, /images/scratch-loans_1.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3675-73ce06da" class="w-layout-cell">
          <div class="case-website container scratch">
            <div class="web-container"><img src="/images/scratch-web.webp" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 68vw, (max-width: 1919px) 67vw, 750px" srcset="/images/scratch-web-p-500.png 500w, /images/scratch-web-p-800.png 800w, /images/scratch-web-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/scratch-web-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/scratch-web.webp 1800w" alt="" class="image-3"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_94f218bf-7c86-48a2-7318-804d19e60b76-73ce06da" class="w-layout-cell">
          <div class="work_text">
            <p>With a complex message and a site that had to speak to both borrowers and lenders, our design had to be as clear as it is persuasive. We delivered an entire rebrand; a new logo, an illustration-heavy new website and fresh copy too.<br><br>Now Scratch is a reminder that life doesn’t have to revolve around debt.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_4de8a0e5-ab81-d579-9dee-b09df83eaf5c-73ce06da" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/Scratch-Icons.mp4" img="/images/work-1.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/work-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/work-1-p-800.png 800w, /images/work-1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/work-1.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd36ad-73ce06da" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/scratch-mobile_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/scratch-mobile_1scratch-mobile.webp 500w, /images/scratch-mobile_1scratch-mobile.webp 800w, /images/scratch-mobile_1scratch-mobile.webp 1080w, /images/scratch-mobile_1scratch-mobile.webp 1600w, /images/scratch-mobile_1scratch-mobile.webp 2000w, /images/scratch-mobile_1scratch-mobile.webp 2600w, /images/scratch-mobile_1.webp 3000w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_3bb80b65-388e-3aaa-74d4-fa498200104c-73ce06da" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/scratch-tee_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/scratch-tee_1scratch-tee.webp 500w, /images/scratch-tee_1scratch-tee.webp 800w, /images/scratch-tee_1scratch-tee.webp 1080w, /images/scratch-tee_1.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_739145bd-111a-9914-7ec5-48ec36bdea0f-73ce06da" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/scratch-module_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/scratch-module_1scratch-module.webp 500w, /images/scratch-module_1scratch-module.webp 800w, /images/scratch-module_1scratch-module.webp 1080w, /images/scratch-module_1.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-bb92b707-a01a-a1e7-7e71-13f5ef35962c-73ce06da" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/scratch-billboard-2_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/scratch-billboard-2_1scratch-billboard-2.webp 500w, /images/scratch-billboard-2_1scratch-billboard-2.webp 800w, /images/scratch-billboard-2_1scratch-billboard-2.webp 1080w, /images/scratch-billboard-2_1scratch-billboard-2.webp 1600w, /images/scratch-billboard-2_1scratch-billboard-2.webp 2000w, /images/scratch-billboard-2_1scratch-billboard-2.webp 2600w, /images/scratch-billboard-2_1.webp 3000w" alt=""></div>
      </div>
      <div id="footer-line" class="footer-trigger"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
